Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 20:42:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: correct stale entryPoint/strategistPath refs for cpq,
 catalog, approval, digital-twin

- architecture/kernel/phases.json: entryPoint for phase-3-cpq, phase-4-catalog,
  phase-5-approvals pointed at stale flat html/*.html copies instead of the
  canonical war-rooms/<vertical>/ files. This drove the hub's 'Launch ->'
  button mismatch on /war-rooms/index.html. Now consistent with every other
  phase.

- html/js/core/tsm-auto-pipeline.js RELAY_REGISTRY: strategistPath for cpq and
  approval had the same stale flat-path issue. digitaltwin's strategistPath
  pointed at 'digital-twin-war-room.html', a filename that never existed
  (actual file is digital-twin.html) - would have broken auto-pipeline
  navigation for that vertical.

- html/tsm-career-training-platform.html: HC Denial War Room card linked to
  /html/healthcare/hc-war-room.html (404) instead of hc-denial-war-room.html.

- Archived the unreachable, stale duplicate war-rooms/index.html at repo root
  to _archive/dead-root-duplicates/. server.js only ever serves html/war-rooms/
  at that route, so the root copy was dead code and a shadow-duplication trap.

Reviewed, no changes needed:
- html/war-rooms/war-room-prep.html: all 26 internal links resolve
- html/music-command/index.html: all 12 nav-card links resolve
